									</description></item><item><title>Protesters storm Meta offices in India</title><link>https://www.theverge.com/tech/1039732/protesters-storm-meta-offices-in-india</link><guid>https://www.theverge.com/?p=1039732</guid><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 10:15:07 -0500</pubDate><description>
											

						
